+The paper's Section 3 constructs intersection-omitting hypergraphs from
+polynomial-evaluation fibres in F_q^2.  This module keeps those native objects.
+It inverse-generates a short trinomial certificate, surrounds its graph by
+same-distribution translates, and uses the paper's fixed-core construction to
+make every translated graph an independent set.
