a three-point core using at least two different offsets.  Thus no translated
graph contains a core, so every such graph is independent.  Within one block
all 6-edges share three core points and meet in at least three vertices; edges
from distinct affine lines meet in at most one.  Hence intersection size two is
omitted exactly as in the paper's construction.

